  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A star with radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span> and surface temperature <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span> has an apparent brightness of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"b\"></span>. </p>\n<p>What is the time it takes for light emitted by the star to reach Earth?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sigma R^{2}T^{4}}{bc}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sigma R^{2}T^{4}}{bc^{2}}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{4 \\pi \\sigma R^{2}T^{4}}{bc}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{4 \\pi \\sigma R^{2}T^{4}}{bc^{2}}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
